# DIU SmartRoutine — environment overview
# Copy into the matching folder and fill real values. Never commit .env files.
#
# Layout:
#   DIU-SmartRoutine/          ← main (this repo root)
#   ├── frontend/              ← React + Vite  (.env from frontend/.env.example)
#   ├── backend/               ← Express + MongoDB (.env from backend/.env.example)
#   └── package.json           ← npm run dev / build / start
#
# Quick start:
#   1. Start MongoDB locally (or use Atlas) and note the URI
#   2. copy backend/.env.example  → backend/.env  (set MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_DB)
#   3. copy frontend/.env.example → frontend/.env   (optional in local dev)
#   4. npm run install:all
#   5. npm run dev
#
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for every variable.
